wizard_login.description:
## 🚀 Automatic Extraction (3 Simple Steps)

⚠️ **Important**: Use an **Incognito/Private window** with **third-party cookies enabled**!

### Step 1: Open Nest in Incognito Mode
1. Open an **Incognito/Private** browser window:
   - Chrome/Edge: Press `Ctrl+Shift+N` (Windows) or `Cmd+Shift+N` (Mac)
   - Firefox: Press `Ctrl+Shift+P` (Windows) or `Cmd+Shift+P` (Mac)
   - Safari: File → New Private Window
2. **Enable third-party cookies** in browser settings (temporarily)
3. Go to [home.nest.com](https://home.nest.com) and **sign in** with your Google account
4. Wait until the page is fully loaded and shows your Nest devices

### Step 2: Run the Automatic Extraction Script
1. While on the Nest page, press `F12` to open Developer Tools
2. Click on the **Console** tab (not Network!)
3. Copy this entire script and paste it into the console:

```javascript
(async function() {
  try {
    // Get issue token from performance entries
    const entries = performance.getEntriesByType('resource');
    const issueTokenEntry = entries.find(e => e.name.includes('issueToken'));

    if (!issueTokenEntry) {
      alert('❌ No issueToken found. Please:\n1. Refresh the page (F5)\n2. Wait for it to fully load\n3. Run this script again');
      return;
    }

    const issueToken = issueTokenEntry.name;
    const cookies = document.cookie;

    // Validate
    if (!cookies || cookies.length < 100) {
      alert('❌ Cookies not found or incomplete. Make sure:\n1. You are signed in to home.nest.com\n2. Third-party cookies are enabled\n3. You are using an Incognito/Private window');
      return;
    }

    // Display results
    console.log('\n========================================');
    console.log('✅ CREDENTIALS EXTRACTED SUCCESSFULLY!');
    console.log('========================================\n');
    console.log('Issue Token URL:\n' + issueToken + '\n');
    console.log('Cookies:\n' + cookies + '\n');
    console.log('========================================');
    console.log('📋 Now copy these values from above:');
    console.log('1. Copy the Issue Token URL');
    console.log('2. Copy the Cookies');
    console.log('3. Paste them into Home Assistant');
    console.log('========================================\n');

    // Try to copy to clipboard
    const text = `Issue Token URL:\n${issueToken}\n\nCookies:\n${cookies}`;
    try {
      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);
      alert('✅ Credentials extracted successfully!\n\nBoth values have been copied to your clipboard.\n\nNow paste them into the Home Assistant setup form.');
    } catch (e) {
      alert('✅ Credentials extracted successfully!\n\nPlease copy the Issue Token URL and Cookies from the console output above.');
    }
  } catch (error) {
    console.error('Error:', error);
    alert('❌ An error occurred. Please try again or use the manual method.');
  }
})();
```

4. Press `Enter` to run the script
5. The script will automatically extract and display your credentials
6. **Copy** the **Issue Token URL** and **Cookies** from the console output

### Step 3: Paste the Values Below
1. Paste the **Issue Token URL** into the first field
2. Paste the **Cookies** into the second field
3. Click **Submit**
4. ⚠️ **Do NOT log out** of home.nest.com!

---

💡 **Can't use the console?** You can also use the [Manual Method] if needed.
